 sign imposed, no assetIDs/intercept or new cross-asset weighting.","fit":"Monthly90day matured nonflat pooled3asset samples, identical for both arms, intersect prior futures availability with new context availability across all3assets. Keep original baseline beta trained on original membership, no refit. Offsetlogistic two coefficients each, equal UTCday weights, weighted trainRMS perfeature floor1e-8, normalize thenclip+-3. Minimize mean weighted binary logloss +0.25/2*sum(beta^2). Fixed ridge, no tuning/sweep,42fits. Gradient tolerance1e-7, >=80 distinct training days. Offset computed using current monthly baseline coefficient on those past rows; not an out-of-fold stack.","gaps":"Both corrections fall back exactly to baseline for any missing new context across all3assets; all550362 original evaluation anchors retained. Training missing contexts excluded identically, never use outcomes to choose prediction membership. Evaluate all original nonflat labels only for conditional metrics; future flats cannot be known operationally.","protected":"No source/outcome from2026-08-01 onward. Preserve all old artifacts/code/userfiles/credentials. Small new arrays using existing environment; no orders or deployment. A verified replay or positive historical score is not universal superiority or profitability.","purpose":"Test NEW traded-perpetual price information, rather than changing weights among old experts. The earlier futures-flow study explicitly excluded futures prices; premium-index information was different. No open-interest/position metrics downloaded or scored: source chosen on timestamp integrity before candidate scores.","references":["https://github.com/binance/binance-public-data","https://developers.binance.com/en/docs/catalog/core-trading-derivatives-trading-usd-s-m-futures/api/rest-api/market-data","https://github.com/binance/binance-public-data/issues/491"],"sources":"Reuse90 locally cached official USD-M monthly1m trade-kline ZIPs from Oct(previousyear) through July, checking frozen SHA256 and cached official checksums. Decode candle timestamp/OHLC/volume validity; keep actual close price, not premium/index/mark. No network, no downloads. Source-derived arrays retain gaps without interpolation.","status":"Sequential retrospective research on already explored Jan-Jul2024/2025/2026 BTC/ETH/SOL, not full years, pristine validation or prospective performance. New candidate scores opened only after source preparation and protocol/code hashes frozen.","success":"Stable improvement only if lead_lag passes all9 original gates AND all18 primary full-all-anchor gates AND all18 primary conditional-direction gates against bothcontrols. Fixed selected subset diagnostic not an extra success criterion. Do not promote price_control or redefine success after observing results; report every cohort, all results and all failures.","timing":"Latest included candle OPEN=anchor-120sec and CLOSE=anchor-61sec: one full minute after closure before anchor. Futures61 contiguous closes and spot62 contiguous closes required. Target remains spot return anchor+60 toanchor+360sec. Exchange archive revisions/publication vintage remain unverified; declared delay is conditional replay timing, not point-in-time certification.","uncertainty":"12000 paired7day moving blocks seed271032; quantiles1/1080,1079/1080 inherited unchanged (conservative Bonferroni27 comparisons versus18 primary pair/cohorts). Per fixed endpoint/scope, not simultaneous across endpoints, scopes or prior sequential studies. No bootstrap refit. Each paired gate requires ALLmetric lowergainbounds>0 and>=5positive months for EVERYmetric."}}
